escription":"Soccer","links":{"mobile":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}},"web":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}}}}}],"ad":{"bundle":"espnfc","sport":"Soccer"},"tracking":{"coverageType":"Analysis","leagueName":"English Premier League","sportName":"soccer","trackingId":"dm_260930_COM_SOC_Analysis_What_does_the_future_hold_for_Manchester_Citys_players_20260930_GLOBAL","trackingName":"COM_SOC Analysis (What does the future hold for Manchester City’s players?) 2026/09/30 GLOBAL"}}],"categories":[{"id":81497,"type":"league","uid":"s:600","guid":"119cfa41-71d4-39bf-a790-6273a52b0259","description":"Soccer","sportId":600,"leagueId":600,"league":{"id":600,"description":"Soccer","links":{"mobile":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}},"web":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}}}}},{"id":137781,"type":"league","uid":"s:600~l:700","guid":"6949f3af-300c-35f1-beab-b95669eedd38","description":"English Premier League","sportId":600,"leagueId":23,"league":{"id":700,"description":"English Premier League","abbreviation":"Premier League","links":{"mobile":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/league/_/name/eng.1"}},"web":{"leagues":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/league/_/name/eng.1"}}}}},{"id":142287,"type":"team","uid":"s:600~t:382","guid":"94fd5d7e-35b1-9d52-c9f2-4a37259bea36","description":"Manchester City","sportId":600,"teamId":382,"team":{"id":382,"description":"Manchester City","abbreviation":"MNC","shortDisplayName":"Man City","links":{"mobile":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/382/manchester-city"}},"web":{"teams":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/382/manchester-city"}}}}},{"id":243655,"type":"athlete","uid":"s:600~a:253989","guid":"63b48f6c-a73d-78e7-71b9-21edae6b0e31","description":"Erling Haaland","sportId":600,"athleteId":253989,"athlete":{"id":253989,"description":"Erling Haaland","links":{"mobile":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/253989/erling-haaland"}},"web":{"athletes":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/253989/erling-haaland"}}}}},{"id":696369,"type":"contributor","guid":"2a444df4-ef0c-3bef-bb70-ef5d02615d57","description":"Rob Dawson","slug":"rob-dawson","contributor":{"id":3040,"description":"Rob Dawson"}}],"keywords":["Soccer","English Premier League","Manchester City","Erling Haaland","Rob Dawson"],"story":"<p>Enzo Maresca has played down fears over <a data-player-guid=\"63b48f6c-a73d-78e7-71b9-21edae6b0e31\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/253989/erling-haaland\">Erling Haaland</a>'s fitness after the striker limped off at the end of <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"94fd5d7e-35b1-9d52-c9f2-4a37259bea36\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=382\">Manchester City</a>'s <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/report/_/gameId/401879259\" target=\"_blank\">3-2 win over Ipswich</a> on Saturday.</p>\n<p>Haaland, who scored twice, looked in pain after a heavy challenge with <a data-player-guid=\"7ceb826b-7729-31e3-affd-4a557a96f1e9\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/269343/jack-clarke\">Jack Clarke</a> in stoppage time.</p>\n<p>The Norwegian was already heading off the pitch before the full-time whistle was blown and went straight down the tunnel at the end of the game.</p>\n<p>\"We will see,\" Maresca said afterward. \"Erling said he was OK. I don't have any news at the moment.\"</p>\n<p><photo caption=\"Erling Haaland limped down the tunnel after the match.\"></p>\n<p>Haaland was one of a number of injury worries for City during the game.</p>\n<p><a data-player-guid=\"e2cc0dd4-f3f8-5546-94b9-1196ae4ea7dc\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/154595/mateo-kovacic\">Mateo Kovacic</a>, <a data-player-guid=\"e359b9c8-5a47-33ea-b024-569065793773\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/303785/matheus-nunes\">Matheus Nunes</a>, <a data-player-guid=\"05fe1643-f278-30d1-9518-93e6543907ca\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/328464/nico-oreilly\">Nico O'Reilly</a> and <a data-player-guid=\"ed520531-3344-157f-7be2-dec0351d41db\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/273292/antoine-semenyo\">Antoine Semenyo</a> all picked up problems, with Maresca identifying Semenyo's as the most serious issue.</p>\n<p>\"Unfortunately in 10 minutes we had four or five players [injured] -- Matheus, Kova, Erling, Antoine and Nico also -- but they are inside now and we will see,\" the City boss said.</p>\n<p>\"I asked all of them. Mateo and Kova said they were OK. Erling also said he was OK and Nico, it's still his back if you remember [the injury] against Coventry. It's still the same problem. The only one we need to wait on is Antoine.\"</p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/50201665/man-city-inflatable-banana-craze-sweeps-defiant-etihad-guilty-verdict\" target=\"_blank\">Man City fans' inflatable banana craze sweeps defiant Etihad</a></strong><br>\n<strong>- <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/50117156/manchester-city-guilty-verdict-premier-league-financial-charges-features-explainers\" target=\"_blank\">Man City charges: Features, explainers, what's next after guilty verdict</a></strong></p>\n<p><inline1></p>\n\n\n\n\n","allowAMP":true,"allowAds":true,"allowComments":true,"allowCommerce":true,"allowContentReactions":false,"allowSearch":true,"byline":"Rob Dawson","isLiveBlog":false,"links":{"api":{"self":{"href":"https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50202449"}},"app":{"sportscenter":{"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50202449"}},"mobile":{"href":"http://m.espn.go.com/soccer/story?storyId=50202449"},"web":{"href":"https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50202449/enzo-maresca-plays-fears-erling-haaland-injury-fears-man-city-star-limps-off"}},"premium":false}],"breakingNews":[],"timestamp":"2026-10-18T01:15:13Z","status":"success"}